Z||000005||AL||11-26-2001||08:23 PM||||well i know all that, but when you go thru the room where the shuttle is you hear a explosion and then when i reach the console in the other room, i can get it to complete the floppy, but not the tape that is next to the computer,i know this is dumb but i want to finish this game.as for my indy well the story goes like this, 2xsess put on the forum that there was a indy for sale in calif for 900 but it didn't work,so i contacted the seller and we agreed to meet,well i get there and sure enough it's an indy,the owner was an 18 yr old and her aunt gave her the car,which she brought from arizona,well the kid let it sit for 9 yrs so dad was getting tired of seeing it there and he wanted to sell it as quick as possible,i then tell the kid that i first have to go see another fiero for 500 and that i would get back to him,well that night he emails me and tells me if i really wanted the car he would sell it even lower then 900, so i email him,and tell him that if he could beat the price of 300$ then i would buy it,and if not o well and thanks,well he emails me and tells me 250$ and you can have it,well the next weekend came i paid him 250 and it was sold,now the car has leather seats,and every other option except defrost,heck it even came with a indy scoop,which i took off so i can repaint it,and that's how i stole it,cause to get an indy for this price it has to be in terrible shape.sorry it's so long but come on guys how do i do the game?<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/al_sig4.gif"> <BR>84 Indy (stole it)250$<BR>86 GT restored it  <BR>89 WS6 GTA 5.7L<P>------------------<BR> ||||reg||1
